{"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"platforms":["macOS"],"languages":["swift"],"tokens":[{"text":"let","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"value","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLAccidentalValue","text":"MXLAccidentalValue","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:7IvorMXL18MXLAccidentalValueO"}]}]}],"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLAccidentalText\/value","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL","doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLAccidentalText"]]},"abstract":[{"text":"The value of this element.","type":"text"}],"metadata":{"externalID":"s:7IvorMXL17MXLAccidentalTextV5valueAA0C5ValueOvp","modules":[{"name":"IvorMXL"}],"roleHeading":"Instance Property","role":"symbol","title":"value","fragments":[{"text":"let","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"value","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"MXLAccidentalValue","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:7IvorMXL18MXLAccidentalValueO"}],"symbolKind":"property"},"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/ivormxl\/mxlaccidentaltext\/value"]}],"sections":[],"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"patch":0,"major":0},"kind":"symbol","references":{"doc://IvorMXL/documentation/IvorMXL/MXLAccidentalValue":{"title":"MXLAccidentalValue","url":"\/documentation\/ivormxl\/mxlaccidentalvalue","role":"symbol","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"MXLAccidentalValue","kind":"identifier"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLAccidentalValue","kind":"symbol","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The accidental-value type represents notated accidentals supported by MusicXML. In the MusicXML 2.0 DTD this"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"was a string with values that could be included. The XSD strengthens the data typing to an enumerated list."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"The quarter- and three-quarters- accidentals are Tartini-style quarter-tone accidentals. The -down and -up"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"accidentals are quarter-tone accidentals that include arrows pointing down or up. The slash- accidentals are"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"used in Turkish classical music. The numbered sharp and flat accidentals are superscripted versions of the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"accidental signs, used in Turkish folk music. The sori and koron accidentals are microtonal sharp and flat"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"accidentals used in Iranian and Persian music. The other accidental covers accidentals other than those listed"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"here. It is usually used in combination with the smufl attribute to specify a particular SMuFL accidental. The"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"smufl attribute may be used with any accidental value to help specify the appearance of symbols that share the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"same MusicXML semantics."}],"fragments":[{"text":"enum","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"MXLAccidentalValue","kind":"identifier"}],"type":"topic"},"doc://IvorMXL/documentation/IvorMXL/MXLAccidentalText":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLAccidentalText","title":"MXLAccidentalText","role":"symbol","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"MXLAccidentalText"}],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The accidental-text type represents an element with an accidental value and text-formatting attributes."}],"url":"\/documentation\/ivormxl\/mxlaccidentaltext","kind":"symbol","type":"topic","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"MXLAccidentalText","kind":"identifier"}]},"doc://IvorMXL/documentation/IvorMXL":{"url":"\/documentation\/ivormxl","kind":"symbol","type":"topic","role":"collection","title":"IvorMXL","identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A MusicXML parser, normalizer, validator, and formatter."}]},"doc://IvorMXL/documentation/IvorMXL/MXLAccidentalText/value":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLAccidentalText\/value","abstract":[{"text":"The value of this element.","type":"text"}],"title":"value","role":"symbol","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"let"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"value"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:7IvorMXL18MXLAccidentalValueO","text":"MXLAccidentalValue"}],"type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/ivormxl\/mxlaccidentaltext\/value","kind":"symbol"}}}